{"city": "osaka", "n": "Bread, Espresso & Roastery", "jp": "パンとエスプレッソと珈琲製作所", "cat": "coffee", "tier": "worth", "area": "Tenma", "lat": 34.698946, "lng": 135.508871, "t": "morning", "cost": "¥", "dur": "1h", "cap": "affogato", "tip": "A Showa-era metal factory turned roastery and bakery, full of odd little rooms. You reach the quiet upstairs through an old locker room. Get the affogato. Skip the bacon toast."},
